<% content_for :title, "This connection cannot be set up" %>
<% content_for :surface, "grant" %>

<h1 class="prompt-title">This connection cannot be set up</h1>

<p class="prompt-lede">
  The application that sent you here described itself in a way this server will
  not accept, so nothing has been connected and nothing has been shared.
</p>

<div class="ledger">
  <div class="ledger-row">
    <span class="ledger-label">What it said</span>
    <span class="ledger-value aside-mono"><%= @description %></span>
  </div>
</div>

<p class="prompt-lede">
  Nothing is wrong with your account. The application has to fix this.
</p>
